<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Stat. Office details Nov 1996 CPI figures.</title>
<headline>Hungary Stat. Office details Nov 1996 CPI figures.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Central Statistical Office (KSH) said on Wednesday that the increase in food and durable consumer goods prices in the January-November period was lower than average, but other prices went up faster.</p>
<p>CONSUMER PRICE INDEX (PCT CHANGE)</p>
<p>			Jan-Nov 96	Nov 96	    Weight</p>
<p>			  yr/yr    mth/mth    yr/yr  in index (pct)</p>
<p> Food products	+17.5	+0.6	+16.0	28.4</p>
<p>Alcoholic</p>
<p>beverages/</p>
<p>  tobacco products  +26.8	+0.4	+24.6	 9.5 @</p>
<p> Clothing	     +25.7	+2.0	+23.9	 7.5</p>
<p>Durable consumer</p>
<p>  goods		 +19.8	+0.8	+13.4	 7.4</p>
<p> Household energy   +33.2	+0.6	+24.0	 6.5</p>
<p> Other goods, fuels +26.2	+1.8	+21.2	17.3</p>
<p> Services	     +26.8	+0.3	+22.2	23.4</p>
<p> TOTAL		  +24.0	+0.8	+20.1     100.0</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
